{"id":898,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>为扎实推进2026届毕业生高质量充分就业，精准搭建校企对接桥梁，深度融合产学研协同育人，2026年4月8日，化学与化工学院专场招聘会在东区训练馆顺利举办。在学校招生与就业工作部的大力支持下，本次招聘会汇聚省内外二十余家优质企业，涵盖央企、国企、上市民企、高新技术企业及校友企业，聚焦化工、制药、新材料、生物医药、检测技术等领域，提供近500个工作岗位，需求覆盖本科、硕士及博士全学历层次，为毕业生带来大量适配度高、发展前景广阔的优质岗位。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=LUNLMZL7WVLlr2MozN8MmLZMlCDUmNuZMmLiM4LZnmG4n7-0gihFp2hmCIa0UYh7M1yiM1h2ozrRUmL4o7WRM8MkolCaUzGPLmUsMRrRnlVFMzrRnR9YnzfFL4W7M8CJqjfjo4OeoDAZQDMbqjL0qIbtpYyPLRUYg474MRCPgtA8pUUcc&oid=1384834961&tid=1042&nid=13461&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/CD656F95CB338BC7CB9F0A0124745CEA/55CD82E0/32D7F\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 450px\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=LUNLMZL7WVLlr2MozN8MmLZMlCDUmNuZMmLiM4LZnmG4n7-0gihFp2hmCIa0UYh7M1yiM1h2ozrRUmL4o7WRM8MkolCaUzGPLmUsMRrRnlVFMzrRnR9YnzfFL4W7M8CJqjfjo4OeoDAZQDMbqjL0qIbtpYyPLRUYg474MRCPgtA8pUUcc&oid=1384834961&tid=1042&nid=13461&e=.jpg\"></p><p>学院党委书记吴志远、副书记蔡文涛深入招聘会现场，与众多企业开展深入交流，详细了解行业发展趋势、人才需求标准及岗位供给情况，并达成多项合作共识，为拓展毕业生就业市场、深化校企合作奠定了坚实基础。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=LL4AMVLzNPnlCZLomT7nRUan7WfUzLusoRNiL462MzL8o770gihFp2hmCIa0UYhkUYy4oShkoRA7M4viLlCDnNWVM4UsL4Q7L8M2MzUPL4MFoRfRoRCsU4TFMzVknmNJqjfjo4OeoDAZQDMbqjL0qIbtpYyPLRUYg474MRCPgtA8pUUcc&oid=1384834961&tid=1042&nid=13461&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/CBC39B88D7751F6FBE74736D3CF54133/80C867C9/51BF9\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 400px\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=LL4AMVLzNPnlCZLomT7nRUan7WfUzLusoRNiL462MzL8o770gihFp2hmCIa0UYhkUYy4oShkoRA7M4viLlCDnNWVM4UsL4Q7L8M2MzUPL4MFoRfRoRCsU4TFMzVknmNJqjfjo4OeoDAZQDMbqjL0qIbtpYyPLRUYg474MRCPgtA8pUUcc&oid=1384834961&tid=1042&nid=13461&e=.jpg\"></p><p>招聘会现场秩序井然、气氛热烈。企业通过现场宣讲、资料展示、一对一沟通等形式，全面介绍企业概况、岗位职责、薪酬福利与职业发展路径；多家企业开设现场面试直通车，实现简历投递、初面、复面一站式完成，大幅提升招聘效率。毕业生们着装得体、准备充分，主动与企业HR交流，积极展示专业素养与实践能力，现场达成多项就业意向。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=LM4CMaL4-bLmC4UoNU4LRTknNLPLm-uaM4vsMmARUmN8Ul-0gihFp2hmCIa0n1h2USybMYyaMm9YLl7DLR6kM8QVnNMfLNQVM8C4oz9ZUNnFLR9sL8Q7LzMFMRT7U87Jqjfjo4OeoDAZQDMbqjL0qIbtpYyPLRUYg474MRCPgtA8pUUcc&oid=1384834961&tid=1042&nid=13461&e=.jpg\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/FFA9706821A607B7FEFCA2FE7F3988BD/0873FD13/49DCA\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 360px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=LM4CMaL4-bLmC4UoNU4LRTknNLPLm-uaM4vsMmARUmN8Ul-0gihFp2hmCIa0n1h2USybMYyaMm9YLl7DLR6kM8QVnNMfLNQVM8C4oz9ZUNnFLR9sL8Q7LzMFMRT7U87Jqjfjo4OeoDAZQDMbqjL0qIbtpYyPLRUYg474MRCPgtA8pUUcc&oid=1384834961&tid=1042&nid=13461&e=.jpg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=LL4MM7nmG8MR98UolMVLmvbLlVVnzMuknmUZnz7YMlliM7U0gihFp2hmCIa0nkyDUSybLYyZnzV7o7VRL7-ioRM2MzfVozTknRTfLz-inzMFU4Q7oRV2nNVFLzGbUzUYgjfJQ4Oeo4xw_26m_IX4gDTJQty0LzG8L1yPL4UDLSbw62U8c&oid=1384834961&tid=1042&nid=13461&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/D6A938E1D8AC0B583F50E99BD9A125E3/C6D81FFA/109A42\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 400px\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=LnNUM8L4V7M7l4Uo4NaLNW2LlQfnRvuZolM7L4vYnR9DMmU0gihFp2hmCIa0U1hVMYh7LYyZnl7iLl-aU8LbU4CioR7PMRnRn7MRUl78nzfFL7WkUl7YU4QFM7Uinz9DgjfJQ4Oeo4xw_26m_IX4gDTJQty0LzG8L1yPL4UDLSbw62U8c&oid=1384834961&tid=1042&nid=13461&e=.png\"></p><p>本次参会企业提供的岗位与学院核心专业高度匹配，有效推动毕业生“专业对口、精准就业”。企业对我院毕业生扎实的理论功底、严谨的治学态度及较强的实践能力给予高度评价。</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=LMm9M8nzQkoRrfUoNVRLRLiLNWVUmNusLz7aUm9aLzAfozC0gihFp2hmCIa0MYyDMkhRU1yPMmNbL8UsM7VVMlU8olW7nmrVMm7DnzNiLNWFnmT7oznRMmVFM4rRUNUJqjfjo4OeoDAZQDMbqjL0qIbtpYyPLRUYg474MRCPgtA8pUUcc&oid=1384834961&tid=1042&nid=13461&e=.jpg\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/764CB16993D74AE5D49BDF5E616E952B/F9D94C61/75CBD\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 400px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=LMm9M8nzQkoRrfUoNVRLRLiLNWVUmNusLz7aUm9aLzAfozC0gihFp2hmCIa0MYyDMkhRU1yPMmNbL8UsM7VVMlU8olW7nmrVMm7DnzNiLNWFnmT7oznRMmVFM4rRUNUJqjfjo4OeoDAZQDMbqjL0qIbtpYyPLRUYg474MRCPgtA8pUUcc&oid=1384834961&tid=1042&nid=13461&e=.jpg\"></p><p>此次招聘会既是学院落实就业工作主体责任、服务学生成长成才的重要举措，也是校企携手赋能行业发展、助力人才强国建设的生动实践。下一步，化学与化工学院将持续聚焦毕业生就业需求，不断拓展优质企业资源，丰富就业服务形式，以更实举措、更优服务，全力护航2026届毕业生实现更高质量、更充分就业。</p><p><br></p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://hgxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=LUNLMZL7WVLlr2MozN8MmLZMlCDUmNuZMmLiM4LZnmG4n7-0gihFp2hmCIa0UYh7M1yiM1h2ozrRUmL4o7WRM8MkolCaUzGPLmUsMRrRnlVFMzrRnR9YnzfFL4W7M8CJqjfjo4OeoDAZQDMbqjL0qIbtpYyPLRUYg474MRCPgtA8pUUcc&oid=1384834961&tid=1042&nid=13461&e=.jpg"}